From 4ac6bf68afefea3e8c47fa400f6ca79f13b8b366 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomas Glozar <tglozar@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:21:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 520/634] IA64: perf annotate: Add base ia64 support

Teach perf to disassemble ia64 instructions and do very basic operations
on them to implement base annotate support.

The output is far from perfect, but for start, it is enough.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Tomas Glozar <tglozar@gmail.com>
---
